ational or sub-national INSPIRE data providers.\r\n\r\nThe production process will be explained in an update of the CDDA document (CDDA_v19_2021.pdf) to be provided with the dataset. \r\n\r\nThe dataset is accompanied with a series of files and documents for download: CDDA_2021_v01_public_DesignatedArea.csv, which includes information on the nationally designated sites and designated boundaries for public dissemination; CDDA_2021_v01_public_DesignationType.csv, which contains information about designation types and the national and international legislative instruments, which directly or indirectly create protected designated areas in Europe.</gco:CharacterString>\r\n      </mrl:statement>\r\n      <mrl:scope>\r\n        <mcc:MD_Scope>\r\n          <mcc:level>\r\n            <mcc:MD_ScopeCode codeList="http://standards.iso.org/iso/19115/resources/Codelists/cat/codelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode" codeListValue="dataset" />\r\n          </mcc:level>\r\n        </mcc:MD_Scope>\r\n      </mrl:scope>\r\n      <mrl:source uuidref="c2a68bc9-543a-4cab-a168-aa20ce0d6951" xlink:title="Nationally designated areas (CDDA) for internal use - version 19, Jun. 2021" xlink:href="https://sdi.eea.europa.eu/catalogue/srv/eng/csw?service=CSW&amp;request=GetRecordById&amp;version=2.0.2&amp;outputSchema=http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd&amp;elementSetName=full&amp;id=c2a68bc9-543a-4cab-a168-aa20ce0d6951" />\r\n    </mrl:LI_Lineage>\r\n  </mdb:resourceLineage>\r\n</mdb:MD_Metadata>	2025-10-09T11:12:48.058199Z	2021-06-16T14:28:29.526Z	0	\N	\N	5571	0	mdb:MD_Metadata	iso19115-3.2018	\N	n	n	\N	\N	2	1	2bef455t-af62-2043-571b-875f6936b2e5	c0c9663b-ea1c-4068-b8b5-533f40539bdf
