by each product, as well as to the issues of product consistency (spatial, thematic, temporal) and homogeneity. Quality Assessment: The quality assessment has been performed according to INSPIRE Data Specifications. The data quality elements considered are:\r\n(i) Completeness,\r\n(ii) Logical Consistency,\r\n(iii) Thematic Accuracy,\r\n(iv) Temporal quality and\r\n(v) Usability.\r\nEach of them (excl. the Thematic Accuracy hereafter) forms a section in the QA/QC Procedures.</gco:CharacterString>\r\n      </mrl:statement>\r\n      <mrl:scope>\r\n        <mcc:MD_Scope>\r\n          <mcc:level>\r\n            <mcc:MD_ScopeCode codeList="http://standards.iso.org/iso/19115/resources/Codelists/cat/codelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode" codeListValue="dataset" />\r\n          </mcc:level>\r\n        </mcc:MD_Scope>\r\n      </mrl:scope>\r\n      <mrl:source uuidref="17b26358-df10-4def-9991-fb395ce64933" />\r\n      <mrl:source uuidref="dd62f02d-a9e0-4e4f-906c-d5a913062deb" />\r\n    </mrl:LI_Lineage>\r\n  </mdb:resourceLineage>\r\n  <mdb:metadataMaintenance>\r\n    <mmi:MD_MaintenanceInformation>\r\n      <mmi:maintenanceAndUpdateFrequency>\r\n        <mmi:MD_MaintenanceFrequencyCode codeList="http://standards.iso.org/iso/19115/resources/Codelists/cat/codelists.xml#MD_MaintenanceFrequencyCode" codeListValue="" />\r\n      </mmi:maintenanceAndUpdateFrequency>\r\n    </mmi:MD_MaintenanceInformation>\r\n  </mdb:metadataMaintenance>\r\n</mdb:MD_Metadata>	2025-10-09T11:09:32.361497Z	2018-06-22T08:38:02.000Z	0	\N	\N	2546	0	mdb:MD_Metadata	iso19115-3.2018	\N	n	n	\N	\N	2	1	2bef455t-af62-2043-571b-875f6936b2e5	b1ccb4c2-be13-416c-ac17-246b3b5219cf
