Q_DomainConsistency>\r\n      </mdq:report>\r\n    </mdq:DQ_DataQuality>\r\n  </mdb:dataQualityInfo>\r\n  <mdb:resourceLineage>\r\n    <mrl:LI_Lineage>\r\n      <mrl:statement>\r\n        <gco:CharacterString>The Impervious Built-Up Change 2018-2021 layer was derived by computing the difference between the Impervious Built-Up status layers for reference years 2021 and 2018 (IBU 2021 – IBU 2018) using a change mask, followed by an averaging operation to aggregate pixels to a coarser resolution (20m). The change mask, derived from harmonic coefficients of NDVI data from 2018 and 2021, was used in the process as it served as a proxy for land-cover change.\r\n\r\nChanges to previous release (2018):\r\n- Introduction of a new production system and algorithm (U-Net CNN).\r\n- Reduction of in-situ data dependency for dataset production.\r\n- First Impervious Built-up Change (IBUC) layer (2018-2021).</gco:CharacterString>\r\n      </mrl:statement>\r\n      <mrl:scope>\r\n        <mcc:MD_Scope>\r\n          <mcc:level>\r\n            <mcc:MD_ScopeCode codeList="http://standards.iso.org/iso/19115/resources/Codelists/cat/codelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode" codeListValue="dataset" />\r\n          </mcc:level>\r\n        </mcc:MD_Scope>\r\n      </mrl:scope>\r\n    </mrl:LI_Lineage>\r\n  </mdb:resourceLineage>\r\n  <mdb:metadataMaintenance>\r\n    <mmi:MD_MaintenanceInformation>\r\n      <mmi:maintenanceAndUpdateFrequency>\r\n        <mmi:MD_MaintenanceFrequencyCode codeList="http://standards.iso.org/iso/19115/resources/Codelists/cat/codelists.xml#MD_MaintenanceFrequencyCode" codeListValue="" />\r\n      </mmi:maintenanceAndUpdateFrequency>\r\n    </mmi:MD_MaintenanceInformation>\r\n  </mdb:metadataMaintenance>\r\n</mdb:MD_Metadata>	2026-06-10T07:27:28.70724Z	2025-04-11T09:22:50.695089Z	0	\N	\N	736	0	mdb:MD_Metadata	iso19115-3.2018	\N	n	n	\N	\N	2	1	2bef455t-af62-2043-571b-875f6936b2e5	3641fdef-fb65-42a6-b6ec-92d168a4191b
