<mdq:pass gco:nilReason="unknown" />\r\n            </mdq:DQ_ConformanceResult>\r\n          </mdq:result>\r\n        </mdq:DQ_DomainConsistency>\r\n      </mdq:report>\r\n    </mdq:DQ_DataQuality>\r\n  </mdb:dataQualityInfo>\r\n  <mdb:resourceLineage>\r\n    <mrl:LI_Lineage>\r\n      <mrl:statement>\r\n        <gco:CharacterString>The Impervious Built-Up Change 2021-2024 layer was derived by computing the difference between the Impervious Built-Up status layers for reference years 2024 and 2021 (IBU 2024 – IBU 2021 ) using a change mask, followed by an averaging operation to aggregate pixels to a coarser resolution (20m). The change mask, derived from harmonic coefficients of NDVI data from 2021 and 2024 , was used in the process as it served as a proxy for land-cover change.\r\n\r\nChanges to previous release (2021):\r\n-Sentinel 2 input data from Collection 1 (processing baseline =&gt; 5.00).</gco:CharacterString>\r\n      </mrl:statement>\r\n      <mrl:scope>\r\n        <mcc:MD_Scope>\r\n          <mcc:level>\r\n            <mcc:MD_ScopeCode codeList="http://standards.iso.org/iso/19115/resources/Codelists/cat/codelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode" codeListValue="dataset" />\r\n          </mcc:level>\r\n        </mcc:MD_Scope>\r\n      </mrl:scope>\r\n    </mrl:LI_Lineage>\r\n  </mdb:resourceLineage>\r\n  <mdb:metadataMaintenance>\r\n    <mmi:MD_MaintenanceInformation>\r\n      <mmi:maintenanceAndUpdateFrequency>\r\n        <mmi:MD_MaintenanceFrequencyCode codeList="http://standards.iso.org/iso/19115/resources/Codelists/cat/codelists.xml#MD_MaintenanceFrequencyCode" codeListValue="" />\r\n      </mmi:maintenanceAndUpdateFrequency>\r\n    </mmi:MD_MaintenanceInformation>\r\n  </mdb:metadataMaintenance>\r\n</mdb:MD_Metadata>	2026-06-09T09:24:52.554645Z	2026-04-24T08:08:10.881133Z	0	\N	\N	153	0	mdb:MD_Metadata	iso19115-3.2018	\N	n	n	\N	\N	2	1	2bef455t-af62-2043-571b-875f6936b2e5	a47db5d1-16f9-4576-9889-64c37493189c
